~ start
$> wait(1)
???: Water's beautiful, isn't it?
$> wait(1)
???: You fish yourself?
???: If you do, take a listen.
???: Fishin' isn't just for sport.
???: This line of work requires grit, someone willing to help others and do what is right.
???: You? I don't know. I sense something, but I can't quite put my finger on it.
???: What's your name?
