~ after_name
$> wait(1)
???: {{GameManager.player_name}}, a planet known as 'Greava' has been overrun with invasive fish in their waters. Do you think you can investigate?
- Yes!
	???: Well alright!
- No.
	???: Well alright!
???: I'll provide you with your first rod, but you'll need to be resourceful along the way.
???: Make friends and take their help. Don't be arrogant, {{GameManager.player_name}}.
???: This journey is not yours alone.
$> FishingRodManager.set_fishing_rod(load("res://resources/items/equipment/fishing/rods/default_rod.tres"))
=> END